# Corpus sweep scratch: lifted ROM-derived code, region images and captures.
# Anchored: examples/corpus/ is the sweep's launcher and is committed. The one
# thing kept is each set's hints.txt: the entry points the running game proved
# it needs (tools/corpus.py discover), which are addresses, not ROM content.
/corpus/*
!/corpus/*/
/corpus/*/*
!/corpus/*/hints.txt
/build_corpus/
